# Frontend

## Styling — StyleSheet + `@theme`
- Layout, color, spacing, typography via `useTheme()` / `useThemedStyles()` + `StyleSheet`.
- Tokens: `colors`, `fonts`, `spacing`, `radii`, `shadows` from `@theme`.
- Never hardcode brand hex when a token exists; use `withAlpha` for translucent overlays.
- Shadows/elevation: `shadows` from theme (iOS + Android elevation).

## Screens
- Root wrapper: `SafeAreaView` with themed `backgroundColor: colors.bg`.
- Granular Zustand selectors — never `useGameStore(s => s.character)` whole object.
- No game logic in screens — call store actions only.
- Nav types from `RootStackParamList` / `MainTabParamList` via `@/types`.

## Components
- Props-driven; no direct store access (exceptions: toast/feedback shells).
- Export shared primitives via `@components` barrel.
- `accessibilityLabel` on all `Pressable` / interactive elements.

## Lists & performance
- `FlatList`, `SectionList`, or `FlashList` for lists > 10 items.
- Haptic feedback on state-changing buttons.

## Skill shortcuts
- New screen → `frontend/new-screen`
- New route → `frontend/add-navigation-route`
